) satisfies typeof cs.ClientUnknown)  →  [-semantic]
)                                     → )
)}{cs.lift(                           → }\n      
<                                     → <
span                                  → span
>after</                              → >after</
span                                  → span
>                                     → >
)}</                                  → \n    </
div                                   → div
>                                     → >
))                                    → `
